  "goodToKnow": "Das Gehäuse is a casing or housing: das Uhrgehäuse, das Handygehäuse, das Computergehäuse (the tower case). It's also a snail's shell, das Schneckengehäuse, and the core of an apple or pear, das Kerngehäuse. All the meanings share the idea of a protective little house, since Gehäuse comes from das Haus with the collective prefix ge-. The plural is the same: die Gehäuse."
